**/* Given rectangle of length l and b. Print area of rectnagle.
Constraints:
$1 <= l <= 10^9$
$1 <= b <= 10^9$
Input format:
2 space sperated integer l an b
Output Format
Single number which is area of rectangle
Sample input:
3 4
Sample output:
12
*/**

//CONCEPTS: OVERFLOW
// WHEN WE DO ARITHMETIC OPERATION IT IS STORED IN THE MEMORY AS THE OUTPUT DATA TYPE,
